# 🧞‍♂️ **7-STAGE PIPELINE ORCHESTRATION**

> **APPLY WHEN**: Executing R-GENIE pipeline, managing stage transitions and handoffs
> **CROSS-REFERENCE**: `@00-01_Guidance.mdc` for per-stage details, `@00-02_Mandatory_Stop_Points.mdc` for checkpoints

---

## 🎯 **PIPELINE PHILOSOPHY**

- ✅ **Phase-aware** — Orchestrator drives each agent's full phase workflow
- ✅ **Structured handoffs** — Markdown handoff doc between every stage
- ✅ **One agent at a time** — Load/unload to manage context window
- ✅ **User control** — Checkpoints at every stage boundary + agent internal stops
- ✅ **Resume capable** — State file + handoff docs enable mid-pipeline restart

---

