| Phase | What Happens | Output |
|-------|-------------|--------|
| 0 | Document skeleton + template loading | Skeleton created |
| 1 | Requirements analysis + validation | Requirements validated |
| 2 | Architecture + sequence diagram | Architecture section |
| 3 | Mappings + error/connector diagrams | Mapping tables + diagrams |
| 4 | Document completion | Full design document |
| 5 | Config files + supplementary sections (optional) | Config appendix |

**Rules:** `@r-genie/01_Technical_Design_Agent/rules/01_Technical_Design.mdc`
