## 🔄 **STAGE EXECUTION PROTOCOL**

```
EXECUTE_STAGE(N):
  0. DETECT IDE (Cursor → .cursorignore, Windsurf → .windsurfignore)
  1. ANNOUNCE: "🧞‍♂️ Stage {N}: {Agent Name}"
  2. ENABLE agent in IDE's ignore file (comment the line)
  3. LOAD agent rules (see per-stage rules reference above)
  4. READ previous handoff: project/output_00_orchestrator/handoff-{prev}.md
  5. EXECUTE all agent phases in order:
     - Follow agent's Phase Orchestration rules
     - Respect agent's Mandatory Stop Points
     - Track phase completion
  6. On agent completion → CREATE handoff document (see @00-01_Guidance.mdc for template)
  7. 🛑 STAGE CHECKPOINT (see @00-02_Mandatory_Stop_Points.mdc)
  8. User decides: Continue | Skip | Stop
  9. DISABLE agent (uncomment in ignore file)
  10. UPDATE state file
```

